§ `s 2`

#ASSERT `is a human embryo` `an IVF embryo on day 5 in the laboratory`
#ASSERT NOT `is a human embryo` `an animal embryo`
#ASSERT NOT `is a human embryo` `a cloned embryo at 9 weeks`

#ASSERT `is a human embryo clone` `a cloned embryo on day 10`
#ASSERT `is a human embryo clone` `an embryo split from an IVF embryo`
#ASSERT NOT `is a human embryo clone` `a cloned embryo at 9 weeks`

#ASSERT NOT `is a prohibited embryo` `an IVF embryo on day 14 in the laboratory`
#ASSERT `is a prohibited embryo` `an IVF embryo cultured to day 15`
#ASSERT `is a prohibited embryo` `an embryo flushed from a woman to collect it`
#ASSERT `is a prohibited embryo` `a cloned embryo on day 15`

§ `ss 5, 6`

#ASSERT `placing it contravenes section 5` `a cloned embryo on day 10` `an animal's body` FALSE
#ASSERT `placing it contravenes section 5` `an embryo split from an IVF embryo` `a woman's reproductive tract` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `placing it contravenes section 5` `an IVF embryo on day 5 in the laboratory` `a woman's reproductive tract` TRUE

